        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3a309afd-b673-49ff-b58c-9ec3ef77447a).Image",
        "Description": "Innocent, lighthearted, little white dove\rBlissful, diligent, looking for love\rWhen all of a sudden, they fell from above,\rA blissful, diligent, lovable dove\r\rThey flew together, up high in the air\rFortuitous ones, with a bountiful flair\rWhen all of a sudden, the envious ones\rGave them the greatest fright of their life...\r\rJosue, Godley, Tellez and Chien\rYou&apos;ll all pay one day for making a scene!\rCount your blessings and don&apos;t be too keen\ron turning a glistening pair obscene!",
